OL,3,GNEWSASpeedo Mick to 'suffer' in trunks
OL,4,Aon -10C Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeedo Mick has said he "will suffer"
OL,7,Fin freezing temperatures in his attempt
OL,8,Fto trek to Mount Everest base camp in
OL,9,Fhis trademark swimming trunks.
OL,11,FMichael Cullen, from Liverpool, has
OL,12,Fraised more than #1m in fundraising
OL,13,Fchallenges in his skimpy Everton
OL,14,Foutfit.
OL,16,FAnd now he said he was about to try for
OL,17,Fhis "biggest challenge" in climbing to
OL,18,FEverest base camp in Nepal later this
OL,19,Fmonth in -10C (14F) temperatures.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
