OL,3,GNEWSASpeedo Mick to 'suffer' in trunks
OL,4,Aon -10C Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Everton fan will then fly to
OL,7,FScotland for a 1,000 mile walk from
OL,8,FJohn O'Groats to Lands End as well as
OL,9,Fclimbing Britain's three highest
OL,10,Fmountains to raise a further #1m.
